| Type                                  | Description                                                                                                                                             | Example                                                                            |
| ------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| **1. Conversable Agent**              | An AI agent that primarily communicates with users through natural language. It answers questions, provides information, and assists in conversations.  | ChatGPT, Gemini, AI Customer Support Bot                                           |
| **2. Customized Agent**               | An AI agent built for a specific business domain, using custom data, workflows, APIs, or company rules.                                                 | Bus Booking Agent, Hospital Appointment Agent, Banking AI Assistant                |
| **3. Conversable + Customized Agent** | An AI agent that combines natural conversation with domain-specific knowledge and business actions. It can chat, reason, use tools, and complete tasks. | AI Travel Assistant, AI Restaurant Ordering System, AI Bus Ticket Booking Platform |


============

Comparison Table
----------------

| Feature               | Conversable Agent  | Customized Agent      | Conversable + Customized Agent  |
| --------------------- | ------------------ | --------------------- | ------------------------------- |
| Natural Language Chat | ✅                  | Limited               | ✅                               |
| Domain Knowledge      | General            | Specific              | Specific                        |
| Uses Business Data    | ❌                  | ✅                     | ✅                               |
| Uses APIs & Tools     | Optional           | ✅                     | ✅                               |
| Task Automation       | Basic              | Medium                | Advanced                        |
| User Interaction      | High               | Medium                | High                            |
| Best For              | General assistance | Business applications | Intelligent business assistants |


============

Examples
1. Conversable Agent

User: "What is AI?"

Agent:

AI (Artificial Intelligence) is the simulation of human intelligence by machines.

2. Customized Agent

User: "Show buses from Chennai to Madurai."

Agent:

Searches your bus database
Filters available buses
Returns schedules and fares
3. Conversable + Customized Agent

User: "Book the best AC Sleeper bus from Chennai to Madurai for tomorrow under ₹1200."

Agent:

Understands the request through conversation
Searches the bus database
Compares fares and ratings
Checks seat availability
Books the ticket
Sends confirmation via email or WhatsApp

